mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";color:red;background:yellow;
mso-highlight:yellow;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;
mso-bidi-language:AR-SA'><font style='color:#FF0000; font-size:8px'>[3]</font></span></b></span><![endif]></span></span></span></a></span></i><i><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;color:#C00000'><o:p></o:p></span></i></p>

<p class=3-normalyaz style='margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:
0cm;margin-left:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:35.45pt'><b
style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-size:11.0pt;color:black;
mso-ansi-language:TR'>Yürürlükten Kaldırılan Düzenlemeler<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

